http://www.xfree86.com/4.1.0/Status28.html#28

I have a 8 Meg Matrox Millenium card here that works fine under Xfree86
4.1 using the "xserver-xfree86" server, which is the "all-in-one" server
in this version.  This particular Matrox card uses the "mga" module. 
